## PHẦN 2: Data Model đề xuất cho iZiiApp

### 2.1 Entity — Harvest Planning

```
HarvestPlan
├── id
├── plan_date
├── shed_id / zone_id            (liên kết zone-based partitioning hiện có)
├── created_by (Manager)
├── status: DRAFT | PUBLISHED | IN_PROGRESS | CLOSED
└── total_target_boxes

Shift
├── id
├── plan_id (FK -> HarvestPlan)
├── role: SUPERVISOR | TEAM_LEADER | BOX_MOVER_DAY | BOX_MOVER_DS | BOX_MOVER_AN
├── employee_id
├── start_time
└── shed_room_list (rooms phụ trách)

PickerTeam                        # "Team màu"
├── id
├── plan_id
├── color_code ("Ivory","Pearl"...)
├── team_leader_id
├── headcount
├── rate_estimate (kg/hr hoặc box/hr)
└── member_ids[] (danh sách picker thuộc team)

Room
├── id
├── room_number
├── flush_number
├── zone_id //Plant M1/M2
└── capacity_reference

RoomAssignment                    # Gán team vào room
├── id
├── plan_id
├── room_id
├── box_target
├── trolley_count
├── team_assignments[]            # [{team_color_id, headcount_used}]
